{"5066660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hetja's Adventures", "steam_appid": 5066660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066660/extras/189e674738d88c42452a3ac3c3f714eb.avif?t=1786781016\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066660/extras_big/189e674738d88c42452a3ac3c3f714eb.avif?t=1786781016 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Hetja, a young traveler raised high above the Suspended Forest. Explore the forests, cliffs, ruins, and lakes of Aezharyth to put an end to the curse cast by Kaethior, the Sorcerer of Broken Winds. Your quest will lead you to the dome, where the final confrontation awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌳 Explore five unique worlds filled with platforming challenges, puzzles, and traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Collect every portal fragment to unlock the next stage of your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Battle fantastic creatures and overcome countless dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛡️ Use your shields wisely to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👑 Face Kaethior inside the dome and free the Bird of the Skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066660/extras/01d05f05612f5b18215f0d9db30fc649.avif?t=1786781016\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066660/extras_big/01d05f05612f5b18215f0d9db30fc649.avif?t=1786781016 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress from platform to platform through a variety of environments. Cross wooden bridges, leap across fleeting clouds, climb suspended logs, and avoid the many traps scattered along your path. Every challenge requires careful observation, precision, and perfect timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066660/extras/364035ddffe591b0db47aef776386ae8.avif?t=1786781016\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066660/extras_big/364035ddffe591b0db47aef776386ae8.avif?t=1786781016 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Aezharyth is inhabited by hostile creatures. Living trees, stone men, ravenous fish, fish-men, and immortal serpents will do everything they can to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right moment to fight them... or carefully find another way around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066660/extras/d78fe0fa2dd7fa916a16d6ea57989228.avif?t=1786781016\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066660/extras_big/d78fe0fa2dd7fa916a16d6ea57989228.avif?t=1786781016 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After crossing the lands of Aezharyth and overcoming every danger, enter the mage's dome. The fate of the kingdom now rests in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066660/extras/189e674738d88c42452a3ac3c3f714eb.avif?t=1786781016\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066660/extras_big/189e674738d88c42452a3ac3c3f714eb.avif?t=1786781016 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Hetja, a young traveler raised high above the Suspended Forest. Explore the forests, cliffs, ruins, and lakes of Aezharyth to put an end to the curse cast by Kaethior, the Sorcerer of Broken Winds. Your quest will lead you to the dome, where the final confrontation awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌳 Explore five unique worlds filled with platforming challenges, puzzles, and traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Collect every portal fragment to unlock the next stage of your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Battle fantastic creatures and overcome countless dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛡️ Use your shields wisely to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👑 Face Kaethior inside the dome and free the Bird of the Skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066660/extras/01d05f05612f5b18215f0d9db30fc649.avif?t=1786781016\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066660/extras_big/01d05f05612f5b18215f0d9db30fc649.avif?t=1786781016 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress from platform to platform through a variety of environments. Cross wooden bridges, leap across fleeting clouds, climb suspended logs, and avoid the many traps scattered along your path. Every challenge requires careful observation, precision, and perfect timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066660/extras/364035ddffe591b0db47aef776386ae8.avif?t=1786781016\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066660/extras_big/364035ddffe591b0db47aef776386ae8.avif?t=1786781016 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Aezharyth is inhabited by hostile creatures. Living trees, stone men, ravenous fish, fish-men, and immortal serpents will do everything they can to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right moment to fight them... or carefully find another way around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066660/extras/d78fe0fa2dd7fa916a16d6ea57989228.avif?t=1786781016\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066660/extras_big/d78fe0fa2dd7fa916a16d6ea57989228.avif?t=1786781016 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After crossing the lands of Aezharyth and overcoming every danger, enter the mage's dome. The fate of the kingdom now rests in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Explore the world of Aezharyth in this single-player 3D platformer. Cross diverse environments (forests, cliffs, ruins and lakes), avoid traps, battle the evil mage's creatures (living trees, stone men and fish-men), and restore peace to the kingdom.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066660/384d7f23be22989957956b407de5617d1e6730aa/header.jpg?t=1786781016", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066660/c48881f03e63f9350c8f48ddf8e4d9d926c83c2e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786781016", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5066660/c48881f03e63f9350c8f48ddf8e4d9d926c83c2e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786781016", "website": "https://www.ricco.fr/pages/hetja_aventure.php", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bits<br></li><li><strong>Proce